{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2019-10-31 22:30:00', 'title': 'ALTIVIA KETONES & ADDITIVES, LLC COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF ACETONE DERIVATIVES BUSINESS FROM DOW INC.', 'text': 'ALTIVIA KETONES & ADDITIVES, LLC ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE ACETONE DERIVATIVES BUSINESS FROM DOW INC. (NYSE:DOW) ON AUGUST 13, 2019. THE ACQUISITION INCLUDES PRODUCTION ASSETS LOCATED IN INSTITUTE, WEST VIRGINIA, IN ADDITION TO THE SITE INFRASTRUCTURE, LAND AND UTILITIES. DOW WILL REMAIN A TENANT ON THE INSTITUTE SITE, RETAINING OWNERSHIP OF CERTAIN MANUFACTURING ASSETS. THE TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE BY THE END OF 2019, SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS.\nALTIVIA KETONES & ADDITIVES, LLC COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF ACETONE DERIVATIVES BUSINESS FROM DOW INC. (NYSE:DOW) ON NOVEMBER 1, 2019. \n'}